Salpa Hub — Licensing
=====================

Salpa Hub has no single, repository-wide license. Each package is licensed
individually, and the license is finalized per package as its dependency chain
settles. See LICENSING.md for the full per-package posture and attributions, and
each package's own NOTICE / license headers under packages/<name>/.

Current per-package licenses
----------------------------

  metalparm-vwf   LGPL-2.1
  pdbmdauto       MIT
  metaldock-vwf   Academic / non-commercial (MGLTools-dependent) — until the
                  planned Meeko swap makes it commercially clean

Salpa Hub ships 100% free and open — nothing here is ever paywalled. Premium
execution routes to Salpa Compute, never to this repository.

Full details, third-party attributions, and citations: see LICENSING.md.
